# fixedbugs, defect 2288, 2026-11-07: a variant case of 4,096 one-byte fields,
# past panel 233's line and so built in place (`emit/large_value.hero`'s
# `case_in_place`), a C line per field joined onto one Heroes line: the writer
# grew that line by `+` and the prologue copied the list of the case's hidden
# temporaries at every one it added, the compiler's own work near the square
# of the fields (the case's shape beside the filing's record): 6.67 billion
# instructions of its own before, 4.91 since. Each field holds its own value.

